[ar:Lantern Test Band]
[ti:Paper Lanterns]
[al:Fixtures]
[length:00:32]
[00:01.00]Paper lanterns drifting over quiet water
[00:04.20]Every window keeps a small and patient flame
[00:07.60]We were counting boats that never reached the harbor
[00:11.00]Singing softly till the morning knew our name
[00:14.40]
[00:18.00]Hold the light a little longer
[00:21.10]Let the river carry every word
[00:24.30]Hold the light a little longer
[00:27.40]Till the last of it is heard
